Description: Provides a design-aware scientific workflow framework connecting
    data auditing, scientific design declarations, leakage safeguards, reproducible
    resampling, deterministic and probabilistic modeling, tuning, benchmarking,
    explainability, Deep Learning, Bayesian and conformal inference, typed uncertainty,
    tracking, persistence, deployment, scalable inference, protected external validation,
    and publication reporting through package-native contracts. Version 1.0.0 is the Consolidated Scientific Release source tree. It preserves the
    0.9.0 frozen public API while consolidating protected external validation, reporting,
    Gold/reference fixtures, cross-language contracts, persistence/security safeguards,
    compatibility metadata, release manifests, and final validation entry points. Runtime,
    numerical, optional-backend, rendered-documentation, and CRAN-style certification are
    reported explicitly and are not inferred from source completeness.
